<ix:exclude><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p></ix:exclude>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;">The weighted average remaining lease term for the operating leases was <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i_2026-07-31" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1" id="c501" format="ixt-sec:durmonth">41.2</ix:nonNumeric> months and the weighted average discount rate was <ix:nonFraction id="c502" contextRef="i_2025-10-31" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageDiscountRatePercent" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">9.2</ix:nonFraction>% as of July 31, 2026.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;">For the three months and nine months ended July 31, 2026, cash paid for operating lease liabilities totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c503" contextRef="d_2026-05-01_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">151,961</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction id="c504" contextRef="d_2025-11-01_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">453,334</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. For the three months and nine months ended July 31, 2025, cash paid for operating lease liabilities totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c505" contextRef="d_2025-05-01_2025-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">147,390</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction id="c506" contextRef="d_2024-11-01_2025-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">432,529</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. For the three months ended July 31, 2026, right-of-use assets obtained in exchange for new operating lease liabilities totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c507" contextRef="d_2026-05-01_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RightOfUseAssetObtainedInExchangeForOperatingLeaseLiability" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">30,568</ix:nonFraction>. For the nine months ended July 31, 2026, right-of-use assets obtained in exchange for new operating lease liabilities totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c508" contextRef="d_2025-11-01_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RightOfUseAssetObtainedInExchangeForOperatingLeaseLiability" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">479,254</ix:nonFraction>. For the three months ended July 31, 2025, there were no right-of-use assets obtained in exchange for new operating lease liabilities. For the nine months ended July 31, 2025, right-of-use assets obtained in exchange for new operating lease liabilities totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c509" contextRef="d_2024-11-01_2025-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RightOfUseAssetObtainedInExchangeForOperatingLeaseLiability" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">266,141</ix:nonFraction> and there was a reduction in the right-of-use assets for terminated lease liabilities totaling $<ix:nonFraction id="c510" contextRef="d_2024-11-01_2025-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="occ:ReductionInRightofuseAssetsForTerminationOfOperatingLeaseLiability" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">21,344</ix:nonFraction>.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;">For the three months ended July 31, 2026, there were no right-of-use assets obtained in exchange for new finance lease liabilities. For the nine months ended July 31, 2026, right-of-use assets obtained in exchange for new finance lease liabilities totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c511" contextRef="d_2025-11-01_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RightOfUseAssetObtainedInExchangeForFinanceLeaseLiability" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">35,081</ix:nonFraction>. For the three months and nine months ended July 31, 2025 right-of-use assets obtained in exchange for new finance lease liabilities totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c512" contextRef="d_2024-11-01_2025-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RightOfUseAssetObtainedInExchangeForFinanceLeaseLiability" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0"><ix:nonFraction id="c513" contextRef="d_2025-05-01_2025-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RightOfUseAssetObtainedInExchangeForFinanceLeaseLiability" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">188,185</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;">Finance lease right-of-use assets of $<ix:nonFraction id="c514" contextRef="i_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseRightOfUseAsset" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">239,793</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction id="c515" contextRef="i_2025-10-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseRightOfUseAsset" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">257,986</ix:nonFraction> were included in <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c516">other assets</span> at July 31, 2026 and October 31, 2025, respectively. Finance lease liabilities of $<ix:nonFraction id="c517" contextRef="i_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseLiabilityCurrent" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">65,504</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction id="c518" contextRef="i_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseLiabilityNoncurrent" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">145,878</ix:nonFraction> were included in <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c519">accounts payable and accrued expenses</span>, and <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c520">other noncurrent liabilities</span>, respectively, at July 31, 2026. Finance lease liabilities of $<ix:nonFraction id="c521" contextRef="i_2025-10-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseLiabilityCurrent" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">87,014</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction id="c522" contextRef="i_2025-10-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseLiabilityNoncurrent" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">144,957</ix:nonFraction> were included in <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c523">accounts payable and accrued expenses</span>, and <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c524">other noncurrent liabilities</span>, respectively, at October 31, 2025. Interest expense related to the finance leases totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c525" contextRef="d_2026-05-01_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseInterestExpense" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">3,510</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction id="c526" contextRef="d_2025-11-01_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseInterestExpense" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">11,305</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, for the three months and nine months ended July 31, 2026. Interest expense related to the finance leases totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c527" contextRef="d_2025-05-01_2025-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseInterestExpense" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">2,070</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction id="c528" contextRef="d_2024-11-01_2025-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseInterestExpense" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">4,098</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, for the three months and nine months ended July 31, 2025. For the three months and nine months ended July 31, 2026, amortization expense related to the finance leases totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c529" contextRef="d_2026-05-01_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseRightOfUseAssetAmortization" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">19,707</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction id="c530" contextRef="d_2025-11-01_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseRightOfUseAssetAmortization" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">53,274</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. For the three months and nine months ended July 31, 2025, amortization expense related to the finance leases totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c531" contextRef="d_2025-05-01_2025-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseRightOfUseAssetAmortization" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">10,511</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction id="c532" contextRef="d_2024-11-01_2025-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseRightOfUseAssetAmortization" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">25,260</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;">The weighted average remaining lease term for the finance leases was <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i_2026-07-31" name="us-gaap:LesseeFinanceLeaseRemainingLeaseTerm" id="c533" format="ixt-sec:durmonth">43.5</ix:nonNumeric> months and the weighted average discount rate was <ix:nonFraction id="c534" contextRef="i_2026-07-31" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:LesseeFinanceLeaseDiscountRate" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">6.4</ix:nonFraction>% as of July 31, 2026.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;">For the three months ended July 31, 2026, cash paid for the finance lease liabilities totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c535" contextRef="d_2026-05-01_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseInterestExpense" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">3,510</ix:nonFraction> for interest and $<ix:nonFraction id="c536" contextRef="d_2026-05-01_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeasePrincipalPayments" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">19,222</ix:nonFraction> for principal. For the nine months ended July 31, 2026, cash paid for the finance lease liabilities totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c537" contextRef="d_2025-11-01_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseInterestExpense" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">11,305</ix:nonFraction> for interest and $<ix:nonFraction id="c538" contextRef="d_2025-11-01_2026-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeasePrincipalPayments" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">55,669</ix:nonFraction> for principal. For the three months ended July 31, 2025, cash paid for the finance lease liability totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c539" contextRef="d_2025-05-01_2025-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseInterestExpense" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">2,070</ix:nonFraction> for interest and $<ix:nonFraction id="c540" contextRef="d_2025-05-01_2025-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeasePrincipalPayments" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">12,449</ix:nonFraction> for principal. For the nine months ended July 31, 2025, cash paid for the finance lease liability totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c541" contextRef="d_2024-11-01_2025-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseInterestExpense" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">4,098</ix:nonFraction> for interest and $<ix:nonFraction id="c542" contextRef="d_2024-11-01_2025-07-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeasePrincipalPayments" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="0">31,854</ix:nonFraction> for principal.</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;">&#160;</p>

